              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika ow'okubanza yateera engwara ye, haazooka orubaale n'omurro bitabwirwemu esagama, byagwa omunsi; kimu kya kasatu eky'ensi kyamekuka, n'ekimu kya kasatu eky'emiti n'obunyansi, byona byahya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.8.7"
