            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika owa kana yateera engwara ye, kimu kya kasatu eky'izooba kyateerwa, hamu n'ekimu kya kasatu eky'okwezi, na kimu kya kasatu eky'enyunyuuzi. Ekyarugiremu: kimu kya kasatu eky'ekyererezi kyabyo kyaswekwa omwirima, omusana gukamara kimu kya kasatu ky'ekiro gutarukujwa. Okwezi n'enyunyuuzi nabyo byamara kimu kya kasatu ky'ekiro bitarukujwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
