              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho narora kandi nahurra isamba erikaba nirihurruka omu burangasa, niryamuza n'iraka likooto liti: “Ziribabona, ziribabona, ziribabona abaliba bali omunsi engwara ezindi isatu obu zirigamba, bamalaika abasatu ezi bali haihi kuteera!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.8.13"
            ]
          }
